OpenSSL with the legacy provider: the openssl module of php74-openssl
built with --with-openssl-legacy-provider (of azsupport/php-src), so
that the ciphers and digests of the legacy provider of OpenSSL work
too: RC4, Blowfish, DES, CAST5, MD4. The same files as php74-openssl:
install one of the two.

The module openssl of PHP 7.4 for php74 of azsupport/ports, which
installs side by side with the other versions of PHP:
lib/php/20190902/openssl.so, loaded by its ini in etc/php74/conf.d, its
headers in include/php74/php/ext/openssl.
